---
import { site } from '../config/site';
---

<footer class="mt-14 border-t border-[var(--bbfc-border)] bg-[var(--bbfc-fill-2)]">
  <div class="max-w-[1040px] mx-auto px-5 py-8 md:py-10">
    <div class="grid gap-7 md:grid-cols-[1.7fr_1fr_1fr] md:gap-8">
      <div>
        <a href="/" class="text-[17px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] text-[var(--bbfc-ink)]">{site.fullName}</a>
        <p class="mt-2 text-[14px] leading-[1.6] text-[var(--bbfc-gray-1)]">{site.tagline}</p>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-[440px] text-[13px] leading-[1.7] text-[var(--bbfc-gray-2)]">
          <span class="footer-description-line">경기 결과보다 오래 남는 축구의 역사·공간·유니폼·서사를</span>
          <span class="footer-description-line">기록하는 박성호(삥이)의 독립 매거진입니다.</span>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p class="footer-label">EXPLORE</p>
        <nav class="footer-links" aria-label="콘텐츠 탐색">
          <a href="/history/">축세</a><a href="/pilgrimage/">축행</a><a href="/archive/">삥이 아카이브</a><a href="/squads/">축쿼드</a><a href="/culture/">축디</a><a href="/play/">축겜</a><a href="/football-made-easy/">축떡</a><a href="/highlights/">H/L</a>
        </nav>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p class="footer-label">BBINGE FC</p>
        <nav class="footer-links" aria-label="사이트 안내">
          <a href="/about/">저자 소개</a><a href="/about/logo/">로고 이야기</a><a href="/editorial-policy/">편집·정정 원칙</a><a href="/contact/">문의</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-7 pt-4 border-t border-[var(--bbfc-border)] flex flex-col gap-3 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between">
      <nav class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-2 text-[12px] text-[var(--bbfc-gray-2)]" aria-label="정책 안내">
        <a href="/privacy/">개인정보처리방침</a><a href="/terms/">이용약관</a><a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>
      </nav>
      <p class="text-[12px] text-[var(--bbfc-gray-2)]">© {new Date().getFullYear()} {site.name}. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .footer-description-line { display: block; }
  .footer-label { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .15em; color: var(--bbfc-gray-2); }
  .footer-links { display: grid; gap: .5rem; margin-top: .7rem; font-size: 14px; color: var(--bbfc-ink-2); }
  footer a { transition: color 150ms ease; }
  footer a:hover { color: var(--bbfc-blue-strong); }
</style>
